stronger response to shadda (the consonant-doubling mark). Persian-style
letter forms select a milder response. Chat/think/tool markers and their
following whitespace have signed responses depending on local context. Document beginnings add script-dependent spikes, and the colon
of an initial 'Title:' metadata field has a large positive response.

