reference operators, comment/fence prefixes, and markup or interface labels.
Dot leaders strengthen with repetition and mathematical-font context.

Positive rules cover some code headers/annotations, edit labels, emoji-start
bytes, and a pure middle-dot prefix, with separate initial-token defaults.
